Command: rg -n -- "program_patterns\.js|await loadProgramPatterns\(\)|program_patterns\.json" index.html js README.md

Result:
- index.html has no js/program_patterns.js script tag.
- README documents program_patterns.json as the normal source and program_patterns.js as file:// fallback only.
- js/monitoring.js loads patterns lazily before existing-program generation.
- js/program-data.js retains file:// fallback support.
